      431.68
    ],
    "text": "ACTING under the powers vested in it by Section 20(5) of the Consumer Affairs Authority Act, No. 09 of 2003, theConsumer Affairs Authority orders that no manufacturer, importer, packer, distributor or trader shall sell, expose or offerfor sale, display for sale the items listed below, above the maximum retail prices given hereunder.",
