    ],
    "text": "Mysore DhalRs. 159/- per kg.Dried Sprats (Imported - Thailand)Rs. 490/- per kg.Dried Sprats (Imported - Dubai)Rs. 405/- per kg.Green MoongRs. 205/- per kg.White SugarRs. 93/- per kg.Potatoes - ImportedRs. 115/- per kg.",
